WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
京张恰好：算得更近，城市更稳。
Just Enough Jing-Zhang: Compute Closer, Keep the City Steady.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:13.000
联网增强：更新内容，原始数据不默认远传。
Connected enhancement: updated content; raw data do not travel by default.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:23.000
恰好本地：签名内容包、近端推理、免账号。
Just-enough local: signed content, near-edge inference, no account.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:33.000
人工或传统：纸质地图、机械标牌、电话和值班人员构成完整等价服务。
Human or conventional: paper maps, mechanical signs, telephones, and staff form a complete equivalent service.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
能降级，才值得采纳；始终保留人类责任、申诉和退出。
Adopt only what degrades gracefully; retain human ownership, appeal, and exit.
